{% call m.section("gray", class="intro") %}
  <p class="intro__text lead">For over two decades, Silverscreen Decoration &amp; Fulfillment has equipped businesses nationwide with customized garment decoration and reliable fulfillment services. We combine American craftsmanship with advanced technology to help your brand stand out and thrive.</p>
  <div class="intro__buttons">
    {{ m.button("Take A Virtual Tour", "/virtual-tour", "blue") }}
    {{ m.button("What We Offer", "#services", "navy") }}
  </div>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.section("white", class="why") %}
  <h2 class="section-title">Why <span class="accent-color">Choose</span> Silverscreen Decoration &amp; Fulfillment for your Custom Apparel Decoration?</h2>
  {{ m.divider() }}
  <div class="card-grid">
    {% call m.card("Experience That Matters", "award") %}
      <p>Decades of expertise and a demonstrated history of empowering businesses like yours.</p>
    {% endcall %}
    {% call m.card("High-Volume, Scalable Production", "production") %}
      <p>With over 110 dedicated garment decorators and more than 56,000 square feet of production space, we can handle any size project by working two shifts.</p>
    {% endcall %}
    {% call m.card("Comprehensive Services", "services") %}
      <p><a href="/screen-print">Screen printing</a>, <a href="/embroidery">embroidery</a>, digital printing (<a href="/dtg-printing">DTG</a>/<a href="/dtf">DTF</a>), and end-to-end <a href="/fulfillment">fulfillment</a>, all under one roof.</p>
    {% endcall %}
    {% call m.card("Strategic Location", "location") %}
      <p>Enjoy faster shipping and shorter transit times from our Reno, NV facility. UPS hub for 1-2 day ground shipping to the western 11 states. LAT, S&amp;S Active Wear, and SANMAR, all located locally, offer next-day receipt of apparel for decoration.</p>
    {% endcall %}
    {% call m.card("Client-Focused Partnership", "partnership") %}
      <p>Your goals influence our solutions. We function as an extension of your team. Our proprietary <a href="/technology">customer portal</a> is built for real-time order management.</p>
    {% endcall %}
    {% call m.card("Consistent Quality", "quality") %}
      <p>Each custom garment adheres to rigorous quality standards, ensuring that you uphold a consistent and polished brand image.</p>
    {% endcall %}
  </div>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.section("blue", id="services", class="services") %}
  <h2 class="section-title">What We Offer</h2>
  {{ m.divider("white") }}

  {% call m.featureRow("images/shared/screen-print-press.jpg", "Automatic screen printing press on the Silverscreen production floor", '<a href="/screen-print">Screen Printing</a>') %}
    <p>Vibrant, bold, and built to last, our <a href="/screen-print">screen printing</a> delivers crisp graphics and vivid colors for all your apparel needs. Designed for high-volume orders and repeated wear. Additionally, we have high-color-capacity presses and oversized capabilities.</p>
    <div class="feature__buttons">{{ m.button("Learn More", "/screen-print", "navy") }}</div>
  {% endcall %}

  {% call m.featureRow("images/shared/embroidery-machines.jpg", "Row of multi-head embroidery machines stitching black backpacks", '<a href="/embroidery">Embroidery</a>', true) %}
    <p>Elevate your brand’s look with precision <a href="/embroidery">embroidery</a> on polos, jackets, hats, and more. Ideal for projecting a professional, premium image.</p>
    <div class="feature__buttons">{{ m.button("Learn More", "/embroidery", "navy") }}</div>
  {% endcall %}

  {% call m.featureRow("images/shared/dtf-printer.jpg", "Gladiator direct-to-film (DTF) printer with its powder shaker and curing unit", 'Digital Printing (<a href="/dtg-printing">DTG</a>/<a href="/dtf">DTF</a>)') %}
    <p>Bring intricate, full-color designs to life with advanced digital printing. Perfect for complex artwork, photographic detail, or smaller custom runs.</p>
    <div class="feature__buttons">
      {{ m.button("DTF (Direct-to-Film)", "/dtf", "navy") }}
      {{ m.button("DTG (Direct-to-Garment)", "/dtg-printing", "navy") }}
    </div>
  {% endcall %}

  {% call m.featureRow("images/shared/warehouse-aisle.jpg", "Fulfillment warehouse aisle lined with shelving full of boxed inventory and a forklift at the end", '<a href="/fulfillment">Fulfillment Services</a>', true) %}
    <p>Expand your business with our dependable fulfillment services. We manage warehousing, inventory, pick-and-pack, and nationwide shipping—optimizing your supply chain so you can concentrate on growth.</p>
    <div class="feature__buttons">{{ m.button("Learn More", "/fulfillment", "navy") }}</div>
  {% endcall %}
{% endcall %}

